        865        DEFINE KIN1 REACT-VAR REACTION=AMINOACI VARIABLE=PRE-EXP  &
        866            SENTENCE=RATE-CON ID1=1
        867        DEFINE KIN2 REACT-VAR REACTION=AMINOACI VARIABLE=PRE-EXP  &
